sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant R as RAG Service
    participant L as LLM Provider
    U->>F: Submit initial narrative
    F->>B: POST /chats/{id}/messages
    B->>D: Persist message and queued run
    B-->>F: 202 Accepted
    B->>D: Acquire run lease
    B->>D: Load qualifying user messages
    B->>B: Build raw evidence and SHA-256
    B->>R: POST /query(raw evidence)
    R-->>B: Retrieval context and MITRE table
    B->>L: Main analysis structured request
    L-->>B: Prose and provider v3 structure
    B->>B: Bind IDs and validate provenance
    B->>L: Gap analysis and follow-up policy
    L-->>B: Ask one question or proceed
    B->>D: Persist context, assistant message, run outcome
    F->>B: Poll run/thread
    B-->>F: Current persisted state

